layout persistence, tests, and documentation were inherited from dsh-synapse.
The upstream Git history is retained to preserve individual contribution records.

Synapse Canvas is an independently maintained derivative. Multi-harness support
and CodeBuddy / WorkBuddy integration are planned work, rather than capabilities
already provided by the imported baseline.

